# Scripted input for compose_tray.kt's tray (KLIO_WIN_INPUT): at the given
# milliseconds after the tray's first poll, its action, or its menu's item
# chosen by its titles' path, as a click would.
200ms tray action
300ms tray menu Mute
400ms tray menu Mute
500ms tray menu Send/Info
# A disabled item, and a path that is not there: nothing.
600ms tray menu Update
650ms tray menu Help
700ms tray action
800ms tray menu Quit
